{
  "api_version": "oh.war/draft-proposal/v2",
  "proposed_identity": {
    "title": "Changelog",
    "profile": "delivery",
    "assurance": "basic"
  },
  "operations": [
    {
      "op": "create_atom",
      "role": "intent",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "path": "10-intent.md",
      "body": "## Intent\n\n- **outcome:** Establish a structured changelog to track modifications, additions, and deletions in the project.\n- **scope:** All future commits and releases.\n- **evidence:** Presence of `CHANGELOG.md` with entries for recent changes."
    },
    {
      "op": "create_atom",
      "role": "basis",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "path": "20-basis.md",
      "body": "## Basis\n\n- **uncertainty:** The specific format (e.g., Keep a Changelog, custom) and automation level (manual vs. generated) are not yet defined.\n- **source:** Project requirements for traceability and user communication."
    },
    {
      "op": "create_atom",
      "role": "work_order",
      "ordinal": 40,
      "path": "40-work-order.md",
      "body": "## Work Order\n\n- **deliverables:**\n  - `CHANGELOG.md` file.\n  - Update to `README.md` linking to the changelog.\n- **constraints:**\n  - Must follow a consistent format.\n  - Must be updated with every release.\n- **rollback:**\n  - Remove `CHANGELOG.md` and revert `README.md` changes if the approach is deemed ineffective."
    },
    {
      "op": "create_atom",
      "role": "milestones",
      "ordinal": 45,
      "path": "45-milestones.yaml",
      "body": "schema: oh.war/milestones/v1\nmilestones:\n  - id: M1\n    title: Deliver requested outcome\n    stage_refs: [STAGE-001]\n    obligation_refs: [OBL-001]\nstages:\n  - id: STAGE-001\n    title: Implement and check requested outcome\n    executor_kind: agent\n    responsibility_tier: T1\n"
    },
    {
      "op": "create_atom",
      "role": "assurance",
      "ordinal": 60,
      "path": "60-assurance.md",
      "body": "## Assurance\n\n### OBL-001 — outcome\n\n- **scope:**\n  - `CHANGELOG.md` exists and is non-empty.\n  - `README.md` contains a link to `CHANGELOG.md`.\n- **evidence:**\n  - **positive:** `cat CHANGELOG.md` shows content; `grep CHANGELOG README.md` returns a match.\n  - **refusal:** `CHANGELOG.md` is missing or empty; `README.md` lacks the link."
    }
  ]
  ,
  "risk_assessment": "Low risk. The changelog format is flexible and can be adjusted later. No architectural changes are required."
}
